as â€œ<a href="https://consequence.net/2026/06/5-seconds-of-summer-bathroom-incident/">Someone Also Shit Their Pants at a 5 Seconds of Summer Concert</a>â€? And in 2024, someone urinated on the floor of the standing section of a Sabrina Carpenter concert, causing a run on a <a href="https://www.sfchronicle.com/entertainment/article/liquid-death-pit-diaper-concert-19984718.php">fairly horrifying item called a â€œpit diaperâ€</a>, whose mere existence speaks to a wider problem.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/jul/22/pass-the-pit-diapers-why-are-fans-wetting-themselves-to-stand-front-row-at-concerts-olivia-rodrigo-noah-kahan-morgan-wallen">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;QH0poBrQVsZy85JMDFfoi5H6sq8vMau8hfQLebRY-o4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxUPass the pit diapers! Why are fans wetting themselves to stand front row at concerts?ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;AjEVzyIpmUBbIOuvRITlRS0ZdElVePVEqfmnh0SDQpcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkoSyndicationItemƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;pXcPqoI_QByttZ4rtq_qisturlg7Ib6XtvSenRmBPkkƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx©https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/jul/22/pass-the-pit-diapers-why-are-fans-wetting-themselves-to-stand-front-row-at-concerts-olivia-rodrigo-noah-kahan-morgan-wallenƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;lp9jBZTYCIycpWVj4oZSDrtmbcjkzbc1lxkcCJu5ovQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxSpass-the-pit-diapers-why-are-fans-wetting-themselves-to-stand-front-row-at-concertsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;rUc1gWwmsQlOq42aA15YYpMuNM8iaHZlb1LYHOAVdIcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒeright